{"seq":1,"slug":"rule-based-rewrite","title":"基于规则的查询重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/rule-based-rewrite","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于规则的查询重写\">基于规则的查询重写</h1><p>有些查询变换无论数据长什么样都一定更划算：把过滤条件挪到离数据源更近的地方、把绕弯的子查询拉直成连接、把视图的定义直接铺开。这类「稳赚不赔」的改写不需要代价模型来判断收益，靠等价规则就能确定——这就是基于规则的优化（rule-based optimization）。它通常在代价搜索之前先跑一遍，把计划清理得干净紧凑，既提升执行效率，又缩小了后续代价搜索的空间。这一篇讲清几条最重要的重写规则，以及它们为何总是有益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>规则重写作用在 <a href=\"../foundations/relational-algebra-plans\">关系代数与逻辑计划</a> 给出的逻辑计划树上，每条规则都是一次保持结果等价的树变换。它和代价优化的分工很清晰：规则优化处理「一定更好」的，代价优化处理「视数据而定」的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[逻辑计划] --&gt; B[规则重写引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; C[谓词下推]&#10;    B --&gt; D[投影下推/列裁剪]&#10;    B --&gt; E[子查询解关联]&#10;    B --&gt; F[视图展开/常量折叠]&#10;    C --&gt; G[更紧凑的逻辑计划]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[交给代价优化器搜索]\">flowchart TD\n    A[逻辑计划] --&gt; B[规则重写引擎]\n    B --&gt; C[谓词下推]\n    B --&gt; D[投影下推/列裁剪]\n    B --&gt; E[子查询解关联]\n    B --&gt; F[视图展开/常量折叠]\n    C --&gt; G[更紧凑的逻辑计划]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[交给代价优化器搜索]</pre><p>下表列出核心规则及其稳赚不赔的理由。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>做什么</th>\n<th>为何总有益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谓词下推</td>\n<td>过滤尽早执行</td>\n<td>减少上层算子的输入行数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影下推</td>\n<td>不需要的列尽早丢</td>\n<td>减少每行宽度与内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量折叠</td>\n<td>编译期算出常量表达式</td>\n<td>省运行时重复计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子查询解关联</td>\n<td>相关子查询改写为连接</td>\n<td>避免逐行重复执行子查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视图展开</td>\n<td>视图替换为其定义</td>\n<td>让下游规则能继续优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"谓词下推-把过滤推到数据源\">谓词下推：把过滤推到数据源</h2><p>谓词下推（predicate pushdown）是收益最大的一条规则。考虑 <code>SELECT * FROM users u JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.uid WHERE u.age &gt; 30</code>。朴素计划会先连接两表、再对结果过滤年龄。但 <code>u.age &gt; 30</code> 只涉及 <code>users</code> 表，完全可以在连接之前就过滤掉不满足的用户。</p>\n<p>其依据正是 <a href=\"../foundations/relational-algebra-plans\">关系代数与逻辑计划</a> 里的选择下推等价规则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_c(R \\bowtie S) \\equiv \\sigma_c(R) \\bowtie S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。下推后，连接的输入从「全部用户」缩小到「30 岁以上的用户」，连接要处理的数据量直接减少。它之所以稳赚，是因为连接的代价随输入大小增长（见 <a href=\"../access-methods/join-algorithms\">连接算法</a>），而过滤只会让输入变小、绝不会变大。更进一步，下推后的谓词若落到扫描算子上，还可能激活 <a href=\"../access-methods/scan-methods\">扫描与访问路径</a> 里的索引扫描。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投影下推与列裁剪\">投影下推与列裁剪</h2><p>投影下推（projection pushdown，又叫列裁剪）和谓词下推是孪生兄弟，只不过它裁的是列而非行。如果最终只 <code>SELECT u.name</code>，那么从 <code>users</code> 表扫描时就没必要把 <code>address</code>、<code>bio</code> 这些大字段也读出来一路往上传。尽早投影，让流经每个算子的行更窄，减少内存占用和数据拷贝。</p>\n<p>对列式存储引擎（见 <a href=\"../execution/execution-models\">火山模型与向量化执行</a>）这条规则收益尤其巨大——列存本就按列分开放，列裁剪意味着根本不去碰无关列的磁盘块，I/O 直接砍掉。这也是分析型数仓 <code>SELECT *</code> 是反模式的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子查询解关联\">子查询解关联</h2><p>相关子查询是性能陷阱。<code>SELECT * FROM users u WHERE u.spent &gt; (SELECT avg(amount) FROM orders o WHERE o.uid = u.id)</code> 里，内层子查询引用了外层的 <code>u.id</code>，朴素语义是外层每扫一行就把内层重跑一遍——外层 100 万行就重跑 100 万次，等于一个隐藏的嵌套循环。</p>\n<p>解关联（decorrelation / unnesting）把这种逐行重复执行改写成一次性的连接 + 聚合：先一次性算出每个用户的订单均值（<code>GROUP BY o.uid</code>），再和外层连接。这样内层只算一遍，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级。这是规则重写里技术含量最高、收益也最戏剧化的一类，现代优化器（PostgreSQL、SQL Server 等）都内置了多种解关联模式。下面是解关联的直观对照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 改写前：相关子查询，外层每行重跑一次内层&#10;SELECT * FROM users u&#10;WHERE u.spent &gt; (SELECT avg(amount) FROM orders o WHERE o.uid = u.id);&#10;&#10;-- 改写后：内层一次性聚合，再与外层连接&#10;SELECT u.* FROM users u&#10;JOIN (SELECT uid, avg(amount) AS a FROM orders GROUP BY uid) g&#10;  ON g.uid = u.id&#10;WHERE u.spent &gt; g.a;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 改写前：相关子查询，外层每行重跑一次内层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 改写后：内层一次性聚合，再与外层连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>改写后的连接用什么算法、什么顺序，则交回代价优化器决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则优化的边界与启发式\">规则优化的边界与启发式</h2><p>规则优化也有它管不到的地方。它能决定「过滤一定要下推」，但决定不了「三张表按什么顺序连接」——因为后者的好坏取决于各表过滤后到底剩多少行，这是数据相关的，必须靠代价。这条边界划清了规则优化与 <a href=\"cost-based-optimizer\">基于代价的优化器</a> 的职责。</p>\n<p>有一类介于两者之间的「启发式规则」：比如「小表驱动大表」「能用索引就尽量用」。它们大多数时候对，但偶尔会被异常的数据分布坑到，所以更稳健的现代优化器倾向于少用硬启发式、多让代价模型来裁决。不过当统计信息缺失或不可靠时（见 <a href=\"statistics-histograms\">统计信息与直方图</a>），代价模型自身就不靠谱，这时启发式规则反而成了兜底的安全网。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>基于规则的优化处理「无论数据如何都更好」的等价变换，通常在代价搜索前先跑、清理并缩小计划。</li>\n<li>谓词下推把过滤推到数据源，缩小连接输入，是收益最大的规则，还可能激活索引扫描。</li>\n<li>投影下推/列裁剪减少每行宽度，对列式存储能直接砍掉无关列的 I/O。</li>\n<li>子查询解关联把相关子查询的逐行重复执行改写成一次性连接 + 聚合，复杂度从平方降到线性。</li>\n<li>规则优化决定不了连接顺序等数据相关的选择，那是代价优化的领地；统计不可靠时启发式规则可兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于规则的查询重写","id":"基于规则的查询重写"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"谓词下推：把过滤推到数据源","id":"谓词下推-把过滤推到数据源"},{"level":2,"text":"投影下推与列裁剪","id":"投影下推与列裁剪"},{"level":2,"text":"子查询解关联","id":"子查询解关联"},{"level":2,"text":"规则优化的边界与启发式","id":"规则优化的边界与启发式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"连接算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/join-algorithms"},"next":{"title":"基于代价的优化器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/cost-based-optimizer"}}